      "content": "that makes sense. i've already started visualizing the shield. i'm just worried about how i'll know if the communication is actually working. since the intelligences aren't human, how can i distinguish between my own thoughts and the actual signals from the alignment? i don't want to mistake my own imagination for the actual entities.",
